{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender CTX API.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender CTX API.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender ctx api blender ctx api","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender CTX API.md","fileName":"Blender CTX API.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender CTX API","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender Library and Kernel Internals]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Library and Kernel Internals","Blender bContext Structure","Blender Context Main Assignment","Blender Context Store","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender CTX API.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender CTX API.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender ctx api blender ctx api","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender CTX API.md","fileName":"Blender CTX API.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender CTX API","heading":"Blender CTX API","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The CTX API creates, copies, frees, reads, and updates the [[Blender bContext Structure]]. Although its implementation belongs to `blenkernel`, the importance of context gives these functions the `CTX_` prefix instead of the module's ordinary `BKE_` prefix.\n\nAccessors retrieve or assign the current database, scene, window, area, region, Python state, and stored context without exposing `bContext` internals. This interface supports [[Blender Context Main Assignment]], [[Blender Context Store]], operator polling, event routing, and editor drawing.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Library and Kernel Internals","Blender bContext Structure","Blender Context Main Assignment","Blender Context Store","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Fu